      "body": "> Thanks for taking care of the riscv32 job. It would be nice to keep this around, but no point in doing so if it regularly breaks CI. Not sure how to solve that given the timeouts come from getting the submodules. I also don't want to download a pre-built toolchain that might break something later.\r\n\r\nHave you seen https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/35853#issuecomment-5136068456?\r\n\r\nMaybe we can wait a few weeks/months and this may be fixed by upstream at that point?",
